    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stopping the performance\"... that's exactly it. it just feels like such an endless, exhausting lie. i'm just tired of pretending i'm not a hollow person. is there really any other way to be honest about it? like, if someone is fundamentally broken, isn't it just a waste of time to keep trying to fix them?",
